      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Samir Mensah. I am calling about water, a lot of it, across the crosswalk at 300 Rhode Island Avenue, in Historic Hill. Near the school bus stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 300 Rhode Island Avenue. Water across the crosswalk, got it. How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe four inches, across the whole width. [pause] The kids are stepping off the curb into the road to get around it. And the cars, they slow to a crawl going through. I am worried someone will be hit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Is this from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The snow turned to rain, it started Sunday and finished this morning. The drain there is, I think, blocked with slush. Can you tell me when your crew last came by this spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the last visit in front of me. I'll put it in as a priority with the school stop noted, and ask the crew supervisor to call you. Best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. Thank you. I would like to go hiking this spring, so I am planning a trip, but first I want the children safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Someone will be in touch."
    }
  ],
